;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Smash Kung Fu Upper (hyper)
; CNS difficulty: medium
; Description: This is very similar to Ragna the Bloodedge (C-Series)'s Strong and Light Kung Fu Uppers.
;     There is just one HitDef, for a screen-shaking hit. The envshake
;     parameters are used to make this effect. You can find out more about
;     each parameter in the CNS documentation.
;     The fall.recover parameter is set at 0, meaning that p2 cannot recover
;     from the fall by entering his recovery command (for Ragna the Bloodedge (C-Series), that is x+y).
;     This gives the attacking Ragna the Bloodedge (C-Series) a chance to follow up with another attack,
;     such as the Fast Kung Fu Palm.
;     Note that there is a ChangeState controller used to make Ragna the Bloodedge (C-Series) change to
;     a success state if he hits. The success state has Ragna the Bloodedge (C-Series) hold his arm
;     up longer for a dramatic effect.
;Black Onslaught
